WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:01.881
Break the work into ordered phases.

00:00:02.206 --> 00:00:05.294
Give parallel work exclusive ownership and define shared

00:00:05.329 --> 00:00:06.420
interfaces first.

00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:09.718
Write a kickoff with the project location or placeholder,

00:00:10.159 --> 00:00:14.512
baseline, read order, authority, decisions,

00:00:14.896 --> 00:00:19.342
sequence, verification, usage policy, and handoff.

00:00:19.946 --> 00:00:22.488
Explain how the agent should proceed if a model is

00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:24.915
unavailable or usage is unknown.

00:00:25.298 --> 00:00:28.200
Include a checkpoint and stop conditions for a long run.

00:00:28.897 --> 00:00:31.741
Planning does not by itself authorize deployment or

00:00:31.892 --> 00:00:33.413
unrelated external changes.
